                  "blocks": {
                    "text_pxiq3K": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Miner Forge Pro is a <strong>plug-and-play device</strong> that makes its own attempts at solving Bitcoin blocks.</p><p>In pool mining, thousands of miners share the work and split small payouts. In solo mining, your device works alone, about <strong>144 attempts a day</strong>. If it ever solves a block, the block reward goes to the Bitcoin address you set. With a device this size, that is very rare.</p>",
