            "text_DFiHpR": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Most home miners join a pool and share small payouts with thousands of other miners. Miner Forge Pro solo mines: it works on its own attempts at a full Bitcoin block, about 144 a day, automatically. <strong>No setup beyond Wi-Fi, no monitoring.</strong></p><p>Solving a block with a device this size is very rare, and most owners never find one. People buy Miner Forge Pro to learn how Bitcoin mining works, to take part in the network, and for the fun of running a real miner at home.</p>",
