    "section_cF3GM6": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Tmzim4": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Still have questions? Reach out to us anytime at <a href=\"mailto:support@goluvora.com\" title=\"mailto:support@goluvora.com\">support@mineblock.co</a>. We’re here to help.</p>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_jG9Kw9": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "inherit_color_scheme": true,
            "color_scheme": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_nyfWy9": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What are the chances of discovering a block?",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_ignjJx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The mathematical probability of discovering a block with a single hobbyist device is <strong>extremely low</strong>. This device should be viewed as a \"lottery-style\" participant in the network. While individual hobbyists have successfully solved blocks in the past, it is not a predictable source of income.</p>",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_ignjJx"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_8QG6nw": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does buying more miners improve my chances?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_K3WTgV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. Each device operates as an independent node attempting to solve a hash. Operating multiple devices increases your total hash rate, which proportionally increases your statistical probability of block discovery.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_K3WTgV"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_DByEAY": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is my chance to win?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_qdaUBY": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The chances are extremely low. Think of it like a global lottery. Your device continuously generates valid entries, and while odds depend on network difficulty, every single hash has a fair chance. People have already proven small devices can win.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_qdaUBY"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_K7fLT6": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "disabled": true,
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Are there any hidden fees?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Wj8UhR": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. There are no subscriptions or hidden costs. Once you purchase the hardware, you own it, and all hashing power is directed to your chosen address.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Wj8UhR"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_Lgiq6Q": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How does the MinerForge Pro actually work?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_VgfGpw": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Miner Forge Pro connects to the Bitcoin network and does real solo mining: it independently tries to find a valid block hash. It only reads public network data and never accesses your personal information or wallet.<br/><br/>Each attempt is a new try at finding a block, and the odds on any single attempt are very small.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_VgfGpw"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_7j7ewC": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Does buying more miners improve my odds?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_rPUXVd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Each device runs independently with its own attempts, so more units mean more attempts. The odds per device stay very small, so buy the number of miners you would enjoy running.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_rPUXVd"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_M7hKcU": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What are the odds of solving a block?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_jQrFy9": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>Very low.</strong> The odds depend on the network's difficulty, which is set by all the miners in the world. A hobby device like Miner Forge Pro is a tiny share of that, so most owners will never solve a block.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_jQrFy9"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_Fy8YPE": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do I need any technical skills to set this up?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_PieimY": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Not at all. Plug the miner into power, connect it to Wi-Fi once through your phone, and it starts mining. No coding, no special hardware, no experience required.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_PieimY"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_wNi48C": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do I need a computer to run this?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_A3d6Un": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No. Everything runs on the device. You only need a smartphone, tablet or computer for the first Wi-Fi setup. After that, it works on its own.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_A3d6Un"
              ]
            }
          },
